 <h2 id="finding-reasoning-title">What thinking adds</h2>
-<p class="finding-text">9 models played two or more reasoning settings in the same league. At the highest setting, 9 of the 9 had a lower error rate than at the lowest, and 7 of the 9 a higher risk judgement. GPT-6 Astra, low to high: risk judgement 75.8, 74.7, 74.4; error rate 11.8, 11.1, 8.8.</p>
